# PyPI Override Packages
#
# Each subfolder here replaces a PyPI package with native Zig implementation.
#
# Structure:
#   packages/pypi_overrides/{pypi_name}/
#   ├── pypi.json         # Optional: {"aliases": ["alt-name1", "alt-name2"]}
#   └── src/main.zig      # Implementation
#
# The folder name is the primary PyPI package name.
# System auto-generates:
#   - Skip list (prevents PyPI download)
#   - Import mapping (Python import → Zig module)
#
# Example: websockets/
#   pypi.json: {"aliases": ["websocket-client"]}
#   → Skips: websockets, websocket-client
#   → Maps: import websockets → @import("pypi_overrides").websockets
